@lace-lib/cardano-tx-builder

The transaction builder, coin selectors, signer discovery, signed size
estimate and slot conversion were written in this repository.

src/fees.ts and src/output-limits.ts are ported from cardano-js-sdk's
@cardano-sdk/tx-construction 0.29.1
(https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-js-sdk, commit 48019e49), whose
notice follows.

